; benchmark.meta description: Holds Vector Clockwork's 1,000 gears at fit while half its movements turn as stamped transforms with fine teeth, even-odd cutouts and strokes, the demo's defaults, in a real 1440 x 900 window at scale 2 with its toolbar and stats panel, reporting each committed frame's main-thread phases and GPU time.
; benchmark.meta timing: not-recommended
; benchmark.meta profiles: gui-window
